OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with    
OL,6,Fthe chance of a few light showers      
OL,7,Facross Shetland, Orkney mostly dry.    
OL,8,FRain likely to reach Orkney towards    
OL,9,Fevening. Windy with strong to gale     
OL,10,Fsouth or southeasterly winds.          
OL,12,CTonight:FPersistent rain, occasionally 
OL,13,Fheavy, will extend northeast this      
OL,14,Fevening. Then becoming dry in the      
OL,15,Fearly hours with clear periods.        
OL,16,FSoutheasterly gales easing by late     
OL,17,Fevening.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
