OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CSunday:FDry in the morning with some   
OL,6,Fsunshine. Cloudier at times in the     
OL,7,Fafternoon with a few showers. Fresh    
OL,8,Fsouthwesterly wind.                    
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FWindy 
OL,11,Fon Monday with rain at times. Early    
OL,12,Frain on Tuesday followed by a few      
OL,13,Fshowers. Bright and breezy with        
OL,14,Fshowers on Wednesday.                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
